# A CONTAINER'S COUNTERS ARE NATIVE METHODS, and a native method has no reference
# form. `length`, `capacity` and `size` were typed as plain u64 members, so
# `.take` of one was read as a take of a u64 and reached the C as
# `z_v3.length.take`, which the C compiler refused.
main: function is {
    xs: ListVal i64
    m: (MapVV k: i64 v: i64)
    ids: (IdSet u32)
    arr: (array t: i64 to: 4)
    raw: (str to: 8)
    a: xs.length.take
    b: xs.capacity.take
    c: m.length.take
    d: ids.capacity.take
    e: arr.length.take
    f: raw.size.take
    print "\{xs.length}"
}
